# openOODA AArch64 Fixtures Per-Fixture Audit

Logline: Per-fixture audit of the 54 aarch64_*.oo fixtures in ooda/fixtures/ with line count, feature, validity, smoke coverage, misfile, and aspirational status for each.

Setup: aarch64-deep-dive.oot (backend inventory) and aarch64-investigations.oot (tier plan) exist. ooda/fixtures-aarch64/ does not exist. No fixture was modified. No compiler was run.

Beats:
  1. Inventory every aarch64_*.oo fixture with line count, feature, and source validity.
  2. Map features tested and features not tested by the fixture set.
  3. Mark fixtures that lack a matching smoke in ooda/scripts/.
  4. Identify misfiled fixtures (wrong directory or no real content).
  5. Identify aspirational fixtures that test shapes the AArch64 backend does not support.

residual: qemu-aarch64 run-probe and refused-clusters audit stay later.

File: openOODA/audit/aarch64-fixtures.oot
Static analysis only. No .oo fixture was modified. No compiler was run.

---

## 1. Inventory

54 aarch64 fixtures exist in `ooda/fixtures/`, no `fixtures-aarch64/` subdir exists (verified by `ls ooda/fixtures/ | grep ^aarch64_ | wc -l` 2026-08-25). All 53 non-empty files carry an Academy header. `pub fn main` is present in 52 of 54 (the two exceptions are `aarch64_nomain.oo` and `aarch64_empty.oo`).

